stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Requested
  Requested --> Rejected: auth / mode / validation fails
  Requested --> Validated: checks pass
  Validated --> Queued: virtual PLC or approved gateway
  Queued --> Acknowledged: controller acknowledges
  Acknowledged --> Completed: process feedback confirms
  Queued --> Failed: timeout / execution error
  Acknowledged --> Failed: feedback not achieved
  Requested --> Cancelled: cancelled before dispatch
  Rejected --> [*]
  Completed --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
